{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mini-golf-game UI copy.details","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mini-golf-game.copy.details","keys":["mini-golf-game.copy.details"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Setiap pusingan menggunakan sembilan susunatur berbeza yang dipilih dari set padang setempat asal. Pergerakan bola, geseran, pukulan bank, halangan, penalti air dan tangkapan cawan disimulasikan pada peranti ini. Kod padang menghasilkan susunan lubang yang sama supaya orang lain boleh bermain padang itu juga.","record_id":"c3b928fad9b0039f68d687a89c40982a71a30b575648f0391bb3797d569e65c7","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.026508752250038,"source":"Each round uses nine distinct layouts selected from an original local course set. Ball motion, friction, bank shots, obstacles, water penalties and cup capture are simulated on this device. A course code reproduces the same hole order so someone else can play that course too.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"1463be604ec36810dbcc1dce1fb1f19f5770a5c4ac2dfb39a9f8edbe7f3b31a7","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Setiap pusingan menggunakan sembilan susunatur berbeza yang dipilih dari set padang setempat asal. Pergerakan bola, geseran, pukulan bank, halangan, penalti air dan tangkapan cawan disimulasikan pada peranti ini. Kod padang menghasilkan susunan lubang yang sama supaya orang lain boleh bermain padang itu juga.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
